{"id":238,"slug":"night-and-fog","title":"Night and Fog","year":1955,"country":"France","duration":32,"spine":197,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/238-night-and-fog","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/28bd50fcd77723579fa97b660e82c8f5/XDDCXaOyUu1u2WeLdPYLNgYhlh9bF7_large.jpg","description":"Ten years after the liberation of the Nazi concentration camps, filmmaker Alain Resnais documented the abandoned grounds of Auschwitz and Majdanek in Night and Fog (Nuit et brouillard), one of the first cinematic reflections on the Holocaust. Juxtaposing the stillness of the abandoned camps’ empty buildings with haunting wartime footage, Resnais investigates humanity’s capacity for violence, and presents the devastating suggestion that such horrors could occur again.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Alain Resnais","slug":"alain-resnais"}],"cast":[],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Alain Resnais","slug":"alain-resnais"},{"role":"Produced by","person":"Anatole Dauman","slug":null},{"role":"Produced by","person":"Samy Halfon","slug":null},{"role":"Produced by","person":"Philippe Lifchitz","slug":null},{"role":"Historical consultants","person":"Henri Michel","slug":null},{"role":"Historical consultants","person":"Olga Wormser","slug":null},{"role":"Music","person":"Hanns Eisler","slug":null},{"role":"Text","person":"Jean Cayrol","slug":null},{"role":"Camera","person":"Ghislain Cloquet","slug":null},{"role":"Camera","person":"Sacha Vierny","slug":null}],"pickedBy":[{"session":870,"title":"ANOHNI’s Closet Picks","date":"2025-09-19","video":"https://vimeo.com/1119945301","celebs":[{"id":78,"name":"ANOHNI"}]},{"session":793,"title":"Hans Zimmer’s Closet Picks","date":"2025-03-14","video":"https://vimeo.com/1068175475","celebs":[{"id":133,"name":"Hans Zimmer"}]}],"related":[217,27968,669],"setFilms":[],"inSets":[]}